      "question": "What happens when catchup is enabled on a Dag?",
      "flags": [],
      "response": {
        "status": "answered",
        "reason": null,
        "answer": "When catchup is enabled on a Dag, the scheduler creates a Dag Run for each data interval that has not been run since the last data interval. This allows the scheduler to execute all previously completed intervals sequentially [C3].",
